    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Welcome to the Time-Traveling 100 Cats Series! \ud83d\udc08 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This installment takes you back to Chang'an during the Tang Dynasty, where you'll search for 100 adorable cats with unique personalities hidden in an exquisitely hand-painted scroll. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy and enchanting hidden object game, test your attention and observation skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Found a cat? Click it! \ud83d\ude3b \u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features\u200b\u200b </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae 1 Level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 100 Hidden Cats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a Authentic Meowing Sounds! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2754 Secrets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Hint System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Adjustable Brightness </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Customizable Background &amp; Cat Colors </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Progress Save </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Zoom</p>",
